{"page": 170, "lines": [{"t": "DSP-2232 OPERATING MANUAL", "x": 284.0, "y": 147.0}, {"t": "12.10. 1", "x": 287.0, "y": 225.0}, {"t": "Select inq Modems", "x": 488.0, "y": 225.0}, {"t": "PACTOR OPERATION", "x": 1576.0, "y": 152.0}, {"t": "The various modems available in the DSP—2232 can be seen with the", "x": 487.0, "y": 305.0}, {"t": "DIRECT (ory) command. To display all the available modems Bimply", "x": 487.0, "y": 345.0}, {"t": "enter the Conmand Mode of the DSP—2232 and then DIR ag shown.", "x": 487.0, "y": 386.0}, {"t": "DIR", "x": 670.0, "y": 470.0}, {"t": "The DSP—2232 will respond with the following:", "x": 486.0, "y": 546.0}, {"t": "(930315)", "x": 328.0, "y": 625.0}, {"t": "1:", "x": 366.0, "y": 665.0}, {"t": "3:", "x": 364.0, "y": 704.0}, {"t": "5:", "x": 365.0, "y": 745.0}, {"t": "10:", "x": 344.0, "y": 785.0}, {"t": "12:", "x": 344.0, "y": 824.0}, {"t": "14:", "x": 344.0, "y": 865.0}, {"t": "16:", "x": 343.0, "y": 905.0}, {"t": "18:", "x": 343.0, "y": 946.0}, {"t": "22:", "x": 342.0, "y": 985.0}, {"t": "25:", "x": 341.0, "y": 1025.0}, {"t": "30:", "x": 341.0, "y": 1065.0}, {"t": "31:", "x": 341.0, "y": 1105.0}, {"t": "32:", "x": 341.0, "y": 1146.0}, {"t": "33:", "x": 340.0, "y": 1186.0}, {"t": "34:", "x": 340.0, "y": 1227.0}, {"t": "35:", "x": 340.0, "y": 1266.0}, {"t": "40:", "x": 339.0, "y": 1307.0}, {"t": "42:", "x": 340.0, "y": 1347.0}, {"t": "44:", "x": 339.0, "y": 1387.0}, {"t": "46:", "x": 339.0, "y": 1427.0}, {"t": "51:", "x": 339.0, "y": 1467.0}, {"t": "61:", "x": 339.0, "y": 1507.0}, {"t": "cmd :", "x": 338.0, "y": 1549.0}, {"t": "12.10.2", "x": 275.0, "y": 2193.0}, {"t": "3/93", "x": 275.0, "y": 2558.0}, {"t": "RTTY/TOR 170: 2125/2295", "x": 424.0, "y": 665.0}, {"t": "RTTY/TOR 425: 2125/2550", "x": 424.0, "y": 704.0}, {"t": "RTTY/TOR 200: PACTOR 2110/2310", "x": 423.0, "y": 744.0}, {"t": "pl Packet 300 bps HF 2110/2310", "x": 423.0, "y": 785.0}, {"t": "pl Packet 1200 bps VHF", "x": 423.0, "y": 825.0}, {"t": "pl Packet 1200 bps PSK", "x": 422