8.0}, {"t": "DSP data Spectrum", "x": 419.0, "y": 1428.0}, {"t": "pl Packet 2400 bps MSK", "x": 419.0, "y": 1468.0}, {"t": "p2 Packet 2400 bps MSK", "x": 419.0, "y": 1508.0}, {"t": "41:", "x": 1152.0, "y": 1311.0}, {"t": "43:", "x": 1152.0, "y": 1351.0}, {"t": "45:", "x": 1151.0, "y": 1391.0}, {"t": "50:", "x": 1152.0, "y": 1431.0}, {"t": "60:", "x": 1153.0, "y": 1470.0}, {"t": "Analog FAX HF", "x": 1231.0, "y": 1309.0}, {"t": "Analog SSTV", "x": 1231.0, "y": 1350.0}, {"t": "RTTY/TOR 1200 bps ASCII OSCAR-II", "x": 1231.0, "y": 1388.0}, {"t": "pl Packet 1200 bps MSK", "x": 1231.0, "y": 1430.0}, {"t": "p2 Packet 1200 bps MSK", "x": 1231.0, "y": 1469.0}, {"t": "Any modem from the list may be loaded with the MODEM command, but", "x": 478.0, "y": 1670.0}, {"t": "only modems 5, 6, 32 and 34 will operate correctly in PACTOR.", "x": 478.0, "y": 1711.0}, {"t": "For example, to operate PACTOR on radio port I and 1200 bps VHF packet", "x": 479.0, "y": 1751.0}, {"t": "on radio port 2 you must select MODEM 34.", "x": 478.0, "y": 1792.0}, {"t": "First, enter the Command", "x": 1355.0, "y": 1792.0}, {"t": "Mode of the DSP—2232 and then type MODEM 34 as shown below:", "x": 477.0, "y": 1832.0}, {"t": "MODEM 34", "x": 661.0, "y": 1915.0}, {"t": "The DSP—2232 will respond with the following:", "x": 477.0, "y": 1993.0}, {"t": "MODem was x (The previous modem)", "x": 681.0, "y": 2075.0}, {"t": "MODem now 34", "x": 681.0, "y": 2115.0}, {"t": "Selectinq A Default PACTOR Modem", "x": 477.0, "y": 2195.0}, {"t": "When you enter the PACTOR mode, the modem number stored in the QPTOR", "x": 475.0, "y": 2276.0}, {"t": "command is automatically loaded. QPTOR defaults to 5 which", "x": 476.0, "y": 2317.0}, {"t": "automatically loads the 2110/2310 single port PACTOR modem. If you", "x": 476.0, "y": 2357.0}, {"t": "wish to load the low—tone modem (MODEM 6), or one of the dual port", "x": 474.0, "y": 2398.0}, {"t": "PACTOR modems (MODEM 32 or 34), enter the corresponding modem number", "x": 476.0, "y": 2438.0}, {"t": "into QPTOR.", "x": 478.0, "y": 2480.0}, {"t": "12-16", "x": 1094.0, "y": 2562.0}]}